@startuml
' SSD – UC-06: View Product Details
title SSD – UC-06: View Product Details

actor "Buyer" as Buyer
participant "SmartTech System" as System

== View Product Details ==

Buyer -> System: 1: navigateToProduct(productId)
activate System

System -> System: 2: retrieveProductListing(productId)

alt product not found / inactive
    System --> Buyer: 3: return HTTP 404 / 'Product not found'
else product found
    System -> System: 4: retrieveProductImages(listingId)
    System -> System: 5: retrieveSellerProfile(sellerId)
    System -> System: 6: retrieveProductReviews(listingId, paginated)
    System --> Buyer: 7: returnProductDetailPage(product, images, seller, reviews, averageRating)
end

deactivate System

@enduml